  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 515.04 Defective Decal, Registration Plate. In the event a registrant receives a defective decal or registration plate, the registrant shall return the defective decal or registration plate to the department. The registrant shall be issued a substitute decal or registration plate without charge.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 516.04)",
